Subject: [PATCH] P6 round two: the condition chains (and/or per De Morgan, the
 p-polarity sense, negation kept literal for the bool-strict not), the logical
 rhs miscompile fix (the register rewrite's loose any-register check), and the
 bitwise token rejection (the fuzzer's find: & | ^ and compounds parsed clean
 into crash lanes)

